{"h":3396,"lines":[{"y":0.031831978194770238,"h":0.013370927287215228,"x":0.84973337838536334,"t":"Test 4","c":1,"w":0.061850115458170651},{"w":0.10288065592447918,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463,"t":"CHAIRPERSON:","x":0.074074076770270669,"y":0.16279069741341434},{"c":1,"y":0.19464075359978317,"x":0.074074071222728813,"w":0.17078189849853515,"t":"COUNCILLOR THORNTON:","h":0.010306242638398078},{"x":0.26543210932661776,"t":"the railway line don't have to breathe in car fumes. We've had some","y":0.078488371986088157,"w":0.54115224202473955,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.2654320895555986,"w":0.5041152445475261,"t":"problems with cyclists leaving their bikes chained to the railings","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.093023255679958061},{"w":0.52469136555989582,"c":1,"t":"outside the ticket office, but the station has agreed to provide bike","h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.26543209489537789,"y":0.10895170804534748},{"w":0.096840979258219384,"h":0.012193946029609215,"t":"racks there.","y":0.12326349195597996,"x":0.26536551862535618,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.26748971345670308,"t":"So next on the agenda is 'Proposals for improvements to the","y":0.16133720952839425,"c":1,"w":0.48148147583007811},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"t":"recreation ground'. Councillor Thornton again.","x":0.26543209742898738,"y":0.17726737343386301,"c":1,"w":0.36831275939941405},{"x":0.26543210588031629,"t":"Well, since we managed to extend the recreation ground, we've","y":0.19316843322631327,"w":0.50823043823242187,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"w":0.55144032796223952,"y":0.20930232546107019,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"spent some time talking to local people about how it could be made a","x":0.2654320992931008,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.22379269753458009,"c":1,"t":"more attractive and useful space. If you have a look at the map up on","x":0.26748971242491582,"w":0.55144032796223963},{"y":0.23969375742438415,"w":0.54938273111979163,"c":1,"x":0.26543209112496358,"t":"the screen, you can see the river up in the north, and the Community","h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.015308602538631089,"t":"Hall near the entrance from the road. At present, cars can park","x":0.26739628978593905,"c":1,"y":0.25295428889554494,"w":0.49813461303710932},{"x":0.26748969985180243,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.27031802127595761,"c":1,"t":"between the Community Hall and that line of trees to the east, but","w":0.52263376871744782},{"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"y":0.28621908104672045,"t":"this is quite dangerous for pedestrians so we're suggesting a new car","w":0.55555557250976562,"x":0.26337447699276367},{"w":0.50411524454752599,"x":0.26543208953196995,"c":1,"t":"park on the opposite side of the Community Hall, right next to it.","y":0.30087209288762851,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"w":0.50205759684244788,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.31684334492605348,"x":0.26748971996856191,"t":"We also have a new location for the cricket pitch. As we've now"},{"t":"purchased additional space to the east of the recreation ground.","x":0.26337448264408786,"y":0.33127208489029236,"w":0.51851852416992195,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1},{"t":"beyond the trees, we plan to move it away from its current location,","x":0.26337447984796003,"y":0.34738372079635838,"c":1,"w":0.53703704833984367,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"h":0.016010628150966877,"y":0.36189634873156651,"c":1,"t":"which is rather near the road, into this new area beyond the line of","w":0.5308642069498698,"x":0.26337448085702664},{"x":0.26337449927560896,"y":0.37632508814277543,"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.52263371785481771,"c":1,"t":"trees. This means there's less danger of stray balls hitting cars or"},{"y":0.39356670961602069,"h":0.012285185365710549,"w":0.098916238149007185,"t":"pedestrians.","x":0.26741430876170014,"c":1},{"x":0.26331035641385481,"y":0.40593063951485853,"w":0.54128555297851566,"t":"We've got plans for a children's playground which will be accessible","h":0.017364352555381712,"c":1},{"t":"by a footpath from the Community Hall and will be alongside the","c":1,"x":0.26337448375445471,"y":0.42285041236634502,"w":0.51234568277994796,"h":0.014723203769140047},{"y":0.43760459286123599,"x":0.26327991517350446,"w":0.52076202392578119,"c":1,"t":"river. We'd originally thought of having it close to the road, but we","h":0.017615614847243943},{"y":0.45494186034095585,"x":0.26337448003993608,"t":"think this will be a more attractive location.","w":0.34156379699707023,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"t":"The skateboard ramp is very popular with both younger and older","y":0.46937573600731231,"x":0.26337448191896329,"w":0.52469136555989582},{"c":1,"w":0.54938273111979163,"y":0.48546511614557053,"t":"children - we had considered moving this up towards the river, but in","x":0.26337447796066404,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"the end we decided to have it in the southeast corner near the road.","x":0.26337449616751307,"y":0.50145348825202363,"w":0.54115224202473955},{"c":1,"x":0.26543209208356133,"t":"The pavilion is very well used at present by both football players and","y":0.51590106021118842,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.54320988972981765},{"x":0.26329333366702978,"t":"cricketers. It will stay where it is now - to the left of the line of trees","w":0.53716389973958334,"h":0.017441412585363025,"c":1,"y":0.52972413072853519},{"t":"and near to the river - handy for both the football and cricket pitches.","y":0.54549921710866456,"c":1,"x":0.26326868792573921,"h":0.018060258476697677,"w":0.55161249796549472},{"y":0.56242638384758481,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"And finally, we'll be getting a new notice board for local information,","w":0.53909464518229178,"x":0.26337448800054336,"c":1},{"w":0.52057612101236983,"h":0.013089955625320671,"y":0.57848837197269798,"c":1,"x":0.26337449083867454,"t":"and that will be directly on people's right as they go from the road"},{"y":0.5929000602167257,"x":0.26322127528422334,"w":0.21017761230468751,"h":0.015879162630006993,"t":"into the recreation ground.","c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.84156378661782694,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.40843023240211107,"t":"Q17"},{"x":0.84156378661177522,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q18","c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.49999999984156696},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.53197674402761341,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"t":"Q19","x":0.84156378661177522},{"c":1,"y":0.57703488347256249,"t":"Q20","w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.84156378683811262,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"PART 3","w":0.10500284830729167,"h":0.016201216424733156,"x":0.071984172475744762,"c":1,"y":0.64233543799724191},{"y":0.67151162818755117,"w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.069958847784072159,"t":"JAKE:"},{"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206061,"t":"AMY:","x":0.069958848702994861,"y":0.70348837190547464,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"JAKE:","c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.069958847403413738,"y":0.76598837197615655,"w":0.043209877014160167},{"y":0.79651162775403506,"t":"AMY:","x":0.069958848598889414,"w":0.039094648361206047,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.069920541808340342,"w":0.043286488850911464,"h":0.013208178103461643,"y":0.84295986430516379,"t":"JAKE:"},{"y":0.67137809204015986,"t":"Now that we've done all the research into bike-sharing schemes in cities around","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.63580245971679683,"x":0.16872428442747964,"c":1},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.166666670644989,"y":0.68749999986679844,"c":1,"t":"the world, we need to think about how we're going to organise our report.","w":0.58436213175455731},{"x":0.16872426811573671,"y":0.70200235588002025,"h":0.014567411690072807,"t":"Right. I think we should start by talking about the benefits. I mean it's great that","w":0.63168726603190106,"c":1},{"w":0.64197530110677081,"c":1,"y":0.7179034156896581,"t":"so many cities have introduced these schemes where anyone can pick up a bike","x":0.16872428351326257,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"x":0.16655989325855386,"y":0.73154253813529324,"h":0.017625520029955433,"w":0.61954610188802084,"t":"from dozens of different locations and hire it for a few hours. It makes riding a","c":1},{"x":0.17060978892436887,"y":0.74671406634600457,"h":0.014976858109832514,"c":1,"w":0.25549308776855473,"t":"bike very convenient for people."},{"w":0.57613169352213545,"t":"Yes, but the costs can add up and that puts people on low incomes off in","y":0.76295641951006465,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17078188975812394,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1687242801370121,"y":0.78052325567023695,"w":0.1090534973144531,"t":"some places.","h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"w":0.59670781453450528,"h":0.013086531271782831,"x":0.16872428192544986,"y":0.79505300372713061,"t":"I suppose so, but if it means more people in general are cycling rather than"},{"w":0.63389994303385411,"h":0.017588764253578137,"y":0.8094776025858883,"c":1,"t":"driving, then because they're increasing the amount of physical activity they do,","x":0.16865065257041653},{"t":"it's good for their health.","y":0.82544339724324789,"w":0.19796648661295571,"x":0.16645031856711559,"c":1,"h":0.017544847495143068},{"x":0.16872428004577245,"y":0.84302325568084935,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.60905349731445313,"t":"OK. But isn't that of less importance? I mean, doesn't the impact of reduced"},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.85747938769162768,"t":"emissions on air pollution have a more significant effect on people's health?","x":0.16872428113089274,"w":0.60288065592447915,"c":1},{"w":0.076387189229329411,"t":"Q21\/Q22","h":0.012493488504973671,"x":0.82085990322808089,"y":0.84259046503255175,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"117","y":0.90406976716589638,"x":0.87242798436897695,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"x":0.71953327191129191,"w":0.25425661722819015,"h":0.027004518273019973,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.9556315279170291}],"w":2400}